## 📊 Benchmarked Results & Key Physical Discoveries

### 1. The Anvil Test (Radial Mode $K=0$)
| Method | $\omega_R$ | $\omega_I$ | Width $\Gamma$ | Metric / Error |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| **1. Jost / R-Matrix** | `0.94958927` | `-0.27307842` | `0.54615684` | $|\det \mathcal{J}| = 1.46 \times 10^{-16}$ |
| **2. ECS FEM** | `0.97599171` | `-0.27926716` | `0.55853431` | Angular stability plateau |
| **3. Time-Domain (ECS-Seed)** | `0.97776957` | `-0.27728551` | `0.55457101` | Window $[15.0, 50.0]$ |
| **Agreement (ECS vs TD)** | **0.18%** | **0.71%** | **0.71%** | **IRONCLAD MATCH** |

### 2. Resolution of the $\alpha$-Anomaly ($K=1$)
The apparent mismatch in damping was resolved via threshold relativistic kinematics:
$$k = \sqrt{\omega_R^2 - \mu_P^2} = 0.1536 \implies v_g = \frac{k}{\omega_R} = \mathbf{0.2937 \, c}.$$
Wavepackets propagate at $< 30\%$ speed of light, delaying asymptotic ringdown while preserving channel frequency coherence to **$0.0396\%$**.

### 3. Dual Destruction Mechanism & Tachyonic Vacuum Decay ($\kappa_H = 50.0, \zeta = 20.0$)
- **Bulk Vacuum Decay:** Positive-definiteness condition $\det M^2 = u^2 v^2(4\lambda_H \lambda_\chi - \kappa_H^2) > 0 \implies \kappa_{H,\text{crit}} = 2.000$. Dynamic growth rate $\gamma_{\text{dyn}} = 6.7006\,\text{s}^{-1}$ matches analytical tachyonic mass $\sqrt{48} = 6.9282\,\text{s}^{-1}$ within **$3.28\%$**.
- **Topological Core Collapse:** Attractive dilaton kinetics create an inner well for $\zeta > 1.2$ with lowest core eigenvalue $\lambda_{\min} = -3.8677$ at $\zeta = 20.0$.
- **Parity Protection:** Spatial parity leakage into the magnetic channel $c$ bounded at $\mathcal{P}_{\text{leak}} = \mathbf{6.72 \times 10^{-26}} \ll 10^{-10}$.

