## 🚀 Quickstart & Installation

```bash
# Clone the repository
git clone https://github.com/MariuszMozga/HPWM-Soliton-Dynamics.git
cd HPWM-Soliton-Dynamics

# Install in editable mode
pip install -r requirements.txt
pip install -e .
```

### 1-Click Independent Verification
Run the certified 5-stage verification audit suite:
```bash
python scripts/run_verification.py
```

### Run Pytest Suite
```bash
pytest tests/ -v
```

