## 📁 Repository Structure

```
HPWM-Soliton-Dynamics/
├── .github/workflows/verify.yml   # Automated GitHub Actions CI/CD matrix
├── CITATION.cff                   # Citation metadata (CFF v1.2.0)
├── LICENSE                        # MIT License
├── README.md                      # Repository overview & benchmarks
├── pyproject.toml                 # Modern PEP 517/621 packaging
├── requirements.txt               # Dependencies (numpy, scipy, pytest)
├── data/
│   ├── background.npz             # Certified B=1 soliton spline background
│   └── VALIDATION_CERTIFICATE.json# Cryptographic validation certificate
├── scripts/
│   └── run_verification.py       # 1-click standalone 5-stage verification
├── src/hpwm/
│   ├── __init__.py                # Package init & exposed API
│   ├── angular.py                 # Grand-spin tensors & parity projectors
│   ├── ecs_fem.py                 # Complex exterior scaling FEM solver
│   ├── jost_rmatrix.py            # Multichannel Jost / R-matrix solver
│   ├── model.py                   # Parameters & Euler-Lagrange BVP equations
│   └── timedomain.py              # Deep Space wavepacket simulation
└── tests/
    └── test_suite.py              # Pytest test suite
```

